 bmm: ~{time_fn(step_logits):.3f} ms')\nprint(f'Gram + 2x norm bmm: ~{time_fn(step_G)+time_fn(step_norm1)+time_fn(step_normm):.3f} ms')\n\\\" 2>&1\n\"","aggregated_output":"q-proj: 3.483 ms\nk-proj: 3.483 ms\nlogits bmm: 0.365 ms\np0 softmax: 1.431 ms\np1 logits: 0.144 ms\np1 softmax: 1.418 ms\np_mix lerp: 0.040 ms\nG + tiled: 0.440 ms\nnorm1 (bmm+mul+sum+sqrt): 0.767 ms\nnormm (bmm+mul+sum+sqrt): 0.783 ms\nratio: ~0.002 ms (approx, mutated inputs)\nv-proj: 3.508 ms\np_mix @ v bmm: 0.355 ms\noutput reshape: 0.028 ms\n\n--- case 3: B=1, L=128, C=1280, H=20, D=64 ---\nq+k proj: ~7.223 ms\nv-proj: ~3.675 ms\nlogits bmm: ~0.378 ms\nGram + 2x norm bmm: ~2.096 ms\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
